# Bazel-only patches applied during build to bridge protobuf/absl API gaps
# between the SONiC bookworm/bullseye Make build (apt libprotobuf-dev 3.21) and
# the SONiC trixie Bazel runtime (sonic_rules protobuf 29.0). Patches are not
# committed to the sonic-dash-api submodule's own history — they live only in
# the sonic-buildimage tree that consumes it.
exports_files(glob(["*.patch"]))
